  "source_filename": "dhe_2208__banquet_order_form.pdf",
  "slug": "banquet-order-form",
  "title": "Banquet Order Form",
  "subtitle": "The banquet event order the floor actually works from: room set, service timeline, courses, dietary plating plan, and billing routing.",
  "description": "An original banquet event order covering function identity and billing routing, the room set and minute-by-minute service timeline, the course-by-course menu with the dietary and allergen plating plan, order authorization with the guarantee, open conditions, and distribution to every department that has to execute it.",
  "use_case": "Use as the single operating document for one banquet function, from set through service to teardown, so captains, culinary, beverage, and audio-visual work from the same record. The order closes when it has been distributed and acknowledged and the guarantee and dietary plan are confirmed.",
  "risk_tier": "B",
  "sections": [
    {
